  "japanese_text": "今年の<u>合唱</u>コンクールで、私はクラスの<u>指揮者</u>に<u>立候補し</u>、見事に選ばれた。歌が苦手なクラスメートと<u>根気</u>強く<u>個別</u>練習もした。明日はクラス全体で<u>団結して</u>本番に<u>臨みたい</u>。",
  "english_translation": "At this year’s choir competition, I ran for class conductor and was chosen easily. I showed perseverance in individual practice with my classmates who were not as good at singing. Tomorrow, I hope to unite the whole class and face this performance together.",
